OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny light showers dying out
OL,6,Fthis morning. Otherwise mainly dry
OL,7,Falthough rather cloudy at times.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain will spread across
OL,9,Fthe west later this afternoon. Strong
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds developing across Skye
OL,11,Fand the Western Isles later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy this evening with rain
OL,14,Fspreading from the west across all
OL,15,Fparts. Turning drier and clearer in
OL,16,Fthe early hours. Showers spreading the
OL,17,Fwest later in the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
