OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FWindy with showers, these
OL,6,Fblustery and occasionally heavy. Some
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain in the
OL,8,Fnorthwest. Strong west or
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA few
OL,12,Fearly showers on Friday before rain
OL,13,Fspreads northeast in the afternoon.
OL,14,FBright spells and showers on Saturday,
OL,15,Fturning drier on Sunday. Strong west
OL,16,For southwesterly winds Friday,
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
